---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = 'July 2026';
const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Organization',
  name: 'AI Betting Tips',
  url: 'https://ai-betting-tips.com',
  description:
    'Independent sports betting tips, data-driven predictions and honest bookmaker reviews.',
};
---
<Base
  title="About Us — AI Betting Tips"
  description="Who we are, how our predictions are made, and how we stay independent while earning affiliate commissions."
  active=""
  schema={schema}>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-head">
      <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>About</div>
      <h1>About <em>AI Betting Tips</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">We help sports bettors make more informed decisions with real odds data, an AI value screener and honest, clearly-labelled operator reviews.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>AI Betting Tips is an independent information service for football and sports bettors. We publish free daily predictions, an AI-powered value screener, a fully settled model record and reviews of licensed bookmakers and casinos. Everything is designed to help you understand the odds and the risks — not to promise winnings.</p>

      <h2>How our predictions are made</h2>
      <p>Our predictions start from live market odds collected from multiple licensed bookmakers. From those odds we derive the implied probability of each outcome and look for <strong>value</strong> — situations where a price looks generous relative to the wider market. The AI screener ranks these edges so you can compare them at a glance.</p>
      <p>Two things we are always honest about:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No prediction is a guarantee.</strong> Sports are unpredictable by nature. Our tips are informed opinions, not certainties.</li>
        <li><strong>Our published stats are settled results only.</strong> Win rate and ROI are calculated from bets that have actually finished and been graded against real scores — never cherry-picked.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we stay independent</h2>
      <p>We make money through affiliate commissions: when you sign up with an operator through a link on our site, we may earn a fee at no extra cost to you. This is standard for comparison sites, and we want to be transparent about it.</p>
      <p>Crucially, commercial relationships <strong>do not</strong> buy a better rating. Our bookmaker and casino scores are calculated from fixed criteria (odds quality, payout speed, app, safety and more). A brand cannot pay to move up the list. Any brand shown with a “demo entry” label is a placeholder for layout purposes and is not a recommendation.</p>

      <h2>Responsible gambling</h2>
      <p>This site is strictly for adults aged 18 or over (or the legal age in your country). Betting should be entertainment you can afford, never a way to make money or recover losses. If gambling stops being fun, please read our <a href="/responsible-gambling">Responsible Gambling</a> guide for tools and free, confidential help.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions, corrections or partnership enquiries? Email <a href="mailto:contact@ai-betting-tips.com">contact@ai-betting-tips.com</a> or see our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

      <hr />
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
